{"page":489,"verses":[{"verse_key":"42:52","surah":42,"ayah":52,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ أَوْحَيْنَآ إِلَيْكَ رُوحًا مِّنْ أَمْرِنَا ۚ مَا كُنتَ تَدْرِى مَا ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ وَلَا ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ وَلَـٰكِن جَعَلْنَـٰهُ نُورًا نَّهْدِى بِهِۦ مَن نَّشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِنَا ۚ وَإِنَّكَ لَتَهْدِىٓ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So We have revealed a spirit to you [Prophet] by Our command: you knew neither the Scripture nor the faith, but We made it a light, guiding with it whoever We will of Our servants. You give guidance to the straight path,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","en_gloss":"We have revealed","transliteration":"awḥaynā","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَيْكَ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"ilayka","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":4,"ar":"رُوحًۭا","en_gloss":"an inspiration","transliteration":"rūḥan","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"by","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَمْرِنَا ۚ","en_gloss":"Our Command","transliteration":"amrinā","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُنتَ","en_gloss":"(did) you","transliteration":"kunta","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَدْرِى","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"tadrī","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"the Book (is)","transliteration":"l-kitābu","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْإِيمَـٰنُ","en_gloss":"the faith","transliteration":"l-īmānu","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"42:52"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جَعَلْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"We have made it","transliteration":"jaʿalnāhu","verse_key"